'''Lancer''' (ランサー) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Lancer
|image = E 369.png
|appearance = [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,600¢ - 6,320¢
}}

==Enemy==
He has lower health and attack power compared to other enemies in the collaboration event but has very high range along with 100% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] cats which makes him quite annoying, especially with powerful pushers like [[Gory Dark]] supporting him.

==Strategy==
His slow attack speed allows for units to rush him in between attacks. Rushers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can easily deplete large quantities of his health if he's alone. If he has support, it highly depends on the support he has to figure out how to most optimally handle him, especially since he's commonly used with Archer and Rider.

